{
 "name": "GSP-02 bulk floor re-arbitration \u2014 dense candidate (light 0.92 / dark 0.90 blur floor; engineered stops 0.97/0.92 light, 0.97/0.95 dark) over the saturated tokens that ghosted (2026-08-21)",
 "_doc": [
  "C 'Deep Field' AA declaration. Deterministic-backdrop surfaces (rows/banner/empty/stage/selected) composite over the stage's darkest reachable point:",
  "light darkest stop #E7F0FD + brand pool rgba(46,124,246,0.12) = #D1E2FC; + a conservative 3% grain dip = #CBDBF4 (declared as extra worst base).",
  "dark lightest reachable point (worst for light text): #14151A + pool rgba(20,102,224,0.16) = #14223A; pool over #0E1220 = #0F1F3F; + 3% grain lift = #1B2940.",
  "Chaotic-backdrop surfaces (chrome/bulk + chips ON them) composite over #000/#D92D20/#0B3D8F light and #fff/#D92D20/#0B3D8F dark (unblurred single-color = conservative correct bound).",
  "INK FORKS forced by this script (passing values are the spec tokens):",
  "  light glassMuted #414B5A (eyebrow/subtitle/sort label on chrome \u2014 textSubtle #707070 = 2.69:1 over #000-worst chrome);",
  "  select-multiple ink brandText #0F53BE (app uses brand #1466E0 = 4.17:1 on chip-over-#000);",
  "  dark glassMuted #B8BEC9 (dark textMuted #aaa = 4.39:1 over #fff-worst chrome);",
  "  dark placeholder #C9CFD9; dark chip labels textStrong #F5F5F5;",
  "  severity ramp inks sev2/3/4 -> #0F1B2D (white ink = 2.2/3.0/3.6:1 on the app ramp); sev5 keeps white; sev1 already dark;",
  "  light ink.onStage #525C6B for section headers + footer (textMuted #666 = 4.10:1 over the pool-darkest stage point; the common-law ~#5E6B7C = 3.88:1 \u2014 C's stage is deeper, so C's fork is deeper);",
  "  CTA fill mode-independent #1466E0 (dark brand #4E89EF + white = 3.4:1).",
  "Empty stack = text sits directly on the opaque base.",
  "GSP-02 ADDITION (2026-08-21, Flagstone art-direction Phase 1b). Two new pairings for the BULK tier:",
  "  bulkDense      = the dense BLUR-mode floor: light rgba(255,255,255,0.92) / dark rgba(13,18,32,0.90).",
  "  bulkLiteDense  = the dense ENGINEERED bottom stop (the stop directly under the text at the sheet's foot):",
  "                   light rgba(255,255,255,0.92) / dark rgba(13,18,32,0.95).",
  "CORRECTED PREMISE: FlagDetailModal mounts variant=\"bulk\" with forceEngineered, so it renders the *Lite",
  "micro-gradient, NOT the blur-mode floor. The 0.85 floor the critic named (D8) is the LEGEND/Nearby/About",
  "path; FlagDetail's ghosting comes from glassBulkLite1 (0.90 light / 0.92 dark). Both are densified here.",
  "DARK ASYMMETRY IS MEASURED, NOT TASTE: the plan's dark candidate 0.90 is LESS dense than the shipped",
  "engineered stop 0.92, so applying it to the engineered path would REGRESS the worst ghosting moment in the",
  "app (D2). The dark engineered stop therefore lands at 0.95. Light text under a dark floor bleeds more than",
  "dark text under a light one \u2014 D2 says so in prose; the ghost table in BUILD_REPORT.md says so in numbers.",
  "WORST-CASE BASES for the new surfaces are the saturated tokens that were seen ghosting through:",
  "  severity[2] #F0A030 (the amber pill behind the coordinates), ctaFill #1466E0 (the callout's Open details",
  "  button behind the Legend), plus the shipped chaotic-backdrop set (#000/#fff, #D92D20, #0B3D8F) and the",
  "  dark Tasks card text #F5F5F5 kept as a base in dark.",
  "EVERY INK THAT LANDS ON THE SHEET is paired here, not just the count label the 2026-07-03 set carried:",
  "  textStrong, text, inkGlassMuted, inkSelect, and ctaFill+white (the one filled verb)."
 ],
